{"publicId":"97d4545c-75c4-478a-9d7e-8811de81c519","title":"用户从AT&T切换至Starlink后Seerr服务失效","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T16:41:41.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-06T16:41:41.000Z","digest":"用户从AT&T切换至Starlink后，Seerr服务无法正常搜索和下载影视内容，而Radarr和Sonarr仍可正常使用。该服务依赖第三方影视索引数据库，当前故障影响范围未明确，但Reddit r/selfhosted社区有用户反馈。此前有用户称AT&T网络存在限制，但未更新后续进展。\n\nSeerr作为第三方影视索引服务，其功能实现依赖于网络连接稳定性。Reddit社区用户测试显示，切换至Starlink卫星网络后，Seerr的API调用和索引功能出现异常，而Radarr（电影管理）和Sonarr（剧集管理）等同类服务仍可正常工作。目前无官方解释或修复方案。\n\n该问题暴露了卫星网络（Starlink）与传统电信网络（AT&T）在影视索引服务兼容性上的差异，但具体技术原因、受影响用户数量及修复时间表尚未公布。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T14:53:35.547Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Seerr 服务无法使用","latestReport":{"id":"uh6n2yar2zv2to8vtkmiyc8xv"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f-t-4Sqc8M8M","title":"Seerr 服务无法使用","firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T16:41:41.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"uh6n2yar2zv2to8vtkmiyc8xv","title":"Seerr 服务无法使用","summary":"用户从 AT&T 切换到 Starlink 后，Seerr 服务无法正常搜索和下载电影/电视剧，而 Radarr 和 Sonarr 可以正常访问。","source":{"name":"Reddit r/selfhosted","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T16:41:41.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"uh6n2yar2zv2to8vtkmiyc8xv","title":"Seerr 服务无法使用","summary":"用户从 AT&T 切换到 Starlink 后，Seerr 服务无法正常搜索和下载电影/电视剧，而 Radarr 和 Sonarr 可以正常访问。","source":{"name":"Reddit r/selfhosted","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T16:41:41.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","heat":5.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T17:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T20:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.4,"partic